<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JON" style="id">Lughuru Bible Version 2nd draft 2/6/2006</book>
  <para style="h">Yona</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yon</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yona</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ichitabu cha Yona</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yona</para>
  <para style="imt1">Ichilongole</para>
  <para style="ip">Ichitabu cha Yona cha hambali ne ipfitabu pfingi pfandikighwe ne iwatulandau mne Mbuli tse Imulungu. Ichitabu chino chotsimulila mbuli tsa mtulandau yumwe, yalemile Imulungu chayamlongele atende. Imulungu tsakamlongela Yona aghende Ninawi, bululu likulu lwe Undewa we Asiria, yawalongele iwanu watsileke nzambi tsao. Yona kabama ahepe kutenda Imulungu pfamtumile, kwaapfila iwanu we Asiria wakala wamaadui we iwanu we Isiraeli na kamanya Imulungu katsowonela libatsi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kuya kakangawala ne ipfinu pfingi Imulungu pfamtendile, katoghola kutenda Imulungu pfamlongele. Haho, amwonile Imulungu kawonela libatsi iwanu we Ninawi na kaleka kuwalagha, Yona kandusa kumnug'unikila Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ghamalangulitso makulu mne chitabu achi Imulungu choyobama chiwe chakuwa, na kunoghela kwake na libatsi lyake pfahela misugho.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ipfinu ipfili mne ichitabu:</para>
  <para style="io">Ukukemighwa kwe Yona na kulema Imulungu chayamlongele atende 1.1-17</para>
  <para style="io">Yona pfatoghole nzambi yake ne Imulungu pfamlekelele 2.1-10</para>
  <para style="io">Yona kowapetela iwanu we Ninawi nawo wotsileka nzambi tsawo 3.1-10</para>
  <para style="io">Libatsi lye Imulungu kwe iwanu we Ninawi 4.1-11.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JON 1" />
  <para style="s">Yona pfabamile kumuhepa Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JON 1:1" />Tsuwa limwe Imtwatsa Imulungu kamlongela, Yona imwana wa Amitai, <verse eid="JON 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JON 1:2" />“Uke ughende Ninawi ghumji ghula mkulu, uwalonge iwanu kwaapfila nighona ghamatendo ghawo ghehile.” <verse eid="JON 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JON 1:3" />Lekeni Yona kalema kughenda kwayatumighwe ne Imtwatsa Imulungu. Tsakaghenda mne ghumji ghwa Yopa, kuko kalapfa sendi, kadina mne imeli iighenda isi ya kutali ya Tarisisi, ili amuhepe Imulungu.<verse eid="JON 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JON 1:4" />Lekeni Imtwatsa Imulungu kaghala libeho kulu mne ibahali, inyahemu tsa ng'ulu ng'ani mbaka imeli tsaibama kubeneka. <verse eid="JON 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JON 1:5" />Iwanu yawang'ali wosang'ana mne imeli tsawapfuka ng'ani, chila yumwe kamlilila imulungu wake yamwapfile. Baho wayasa imitsigho mne ibahari ili imeli iwe mbewe na ileke kutsama. Lekeni Yona tsakahulumka kune ichumba cha kuisi che imeli na kuko kawasa fofofo.<verse eid="JON 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JON 1:6" />Imwimilitsi mkulu we imeli kampfika Yona kamlongela, “Ebali ghweghwe kowasa? Ulamke umlombe mulungu wako, songaa katsotwonela libatsi na kutuleka tuwe waghima.”<verse eid="JON 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JON 1:7" />Kuya, iwanu iwosang'ana mne imeli welongela, “Mtse twase tsisimbi tulole nani yatendile mbaka twoghaya pfino.” Tsawatenda apfo, ne tsisimbi tsilamla Yona iyo iyatendile apfo. <verse eid="JON 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JON 1:8" />Wamlongela Yona, “Utulongele sambi, yuhi yatendile mbaka twoghaya pfino? Utenda choni hano? Ulawile mne isi yachi? Likabila lyako nani?”<verse eid="JON 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JON 1:9" />Yona kawedika, “Nene na Mueburaniya, nomtambikila Imtwatsa Imulungu, Imulungu wa kulanga, yalumbile isi ne ibahali.” <verse eid="JON 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JON 1:10" />Kuya Yona kaghendelela kulonga ka yang'ali yomuhepa Imtwatsa Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JON 1:10">Iwanu iwosang'ana mne imeli hawahulike agho wapfuka ng'ani, wamlongela, “Achi choni chautendile?” <verse eid="JON 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JON 1:11" />Chipindi acho ibahali ing'ali itikuka sideke, apfo iwanu iwosang'ana mne imeli wamghutsa, “Tukutende choni ili inyahemu inyamale?”<verse eid="JON 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JON 1:12" />Yona kawedika, “Mnyase mne ibahali, ne ibahali itsenyamala. Mana nene iye yanitendile mbaka inyahemu ino ilawile.”<verse eid="JON 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JON 1:13" />Waleka kumwasa mne ibahari, wegangamitsa kuikwegha imeli ipfike kumwani. Lekeni ng'awadahile bae, kwaapfila ibahali tsaing'ali ighendelela kutikuka. <verse eid="JON 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JON 1:14" />Kuya wamlomba Imtwatsa Imulungu, walonga, “Ghwee Imtwatsa Imulungu, twokulomba, uleke kututenda tufe mne ghamatsi wala uleke kutwona ka twetwe iwo yatumuhonzile imunu yuno yafe! Ambe ghweghwe yutendile agha ghose ghalawile.” <verse eid="JON 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JON 1:15" />Baho wamsola Yona wamwasa mne ibahali, na bahala ibahali itikuke inyamala tulu. <verse eid="JON 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JON 1:16" />Alino liwatenda iwanu iwosang'ana mne imeli wampfuke ng'ani Imtwatsa Imulungu, wamlapfila inambiko na welaghana kumsang'anila Imulungu.<verse eid="JON 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JON 1:17" />Kuya Imtwatsa Imulungu kamghala isomba mkulu kammetsa Yona, naye kakala mne lida lya somba matsuwa madatu chilo na misi.<verse eid="JON 1:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JON 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JON 2" />
  <para style="s">Yona komlomba Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JON 2:1" />Yona hayang'ali kamne lida lye isomba tsakamlomba Imtwatsa, Imulungu wake. <verse eid="JON 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JON 2:2" />Kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:2">“Ghwee Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:2">haning'ali nighaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:2">nikukema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:2">naghwe kunyidika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:2">kulawa kutsimu, tsanikulilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:2">naghwe kuhulika chililo changu.<verse eid="JON 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JON 2:3" />Tsakunyasa hanu hane ghamatsi ighaghendese hasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:3">haghatighati mwe ibahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:3">ghamatsi mengi tsaghanipfingilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:3">ghamawimbi ne ghamatsi ghaluta mchanya mwangu.<verse eid="JON 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JON 2:4" />Tsanonga kunyasa kutali, ndeke kukala hambele yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:4">ndeke kuyona keli Ing'anda yako yenzeluke.<verse eid="JON 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JON 2:5" />Ghamatsi tsaghanitsila mchanya mwangu, na ghanilakila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:5">ibahali yose tsainitsunguluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:5">imvulu ye ibahali tsainighubika mwitwi.<verse eid="JON 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JON 2:6" />Tsanihulumka mbaka kuhisi kwapfanzile ipfidunda, mne <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">iisi ine mibani iindighwe ghamatsuwa ghose, mana yake kutsimu</char></note>iisi ine mibani iindighwe ghamatsuwa ghose.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:6">Lekeni ghweghwe, Imtwatsa Imulungu wangu kunilapfa mne lipondo alyo aku namghima.<verse eid="JON 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JON 2:7" />Haning'ali nihila no ukufa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:7">tsanikukumbuka ghweghwe, Imtwatsa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:7">tsanikulomba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:7">naghwe tsakuhulika mne Ing'anda yako yenzeluke.<verse eid="JON 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JON 2:8" />Iwanu iwotambikila pfinyagho pfa ughutsu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:8">woulema ghendo uluso waubama kuwatendela.<verse eid="JON 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JON 2:9" />Lekeni nene nitsokwimbila wila wa kukutunya, nitsokulapfila nambiko</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:9">na kutenda achila chanilaghane naghwe.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:9">Imtwatsa Imulungu iye yokombola.”<verse eid="JON 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JON 2:10" />Baho, Imtwatsa Imulungu kamlaghitsa isomba yamdeke Yona kumwani, naye katenda apfo.<verse eid="JON 2:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JON 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JON 3" />
  <para style="s">Iwanu wa Ninawi wotsileka nzambi tsawo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JON 3:1" />Kuya Imtwatsa Imulungu kalonga lwakeli na Yona. Kalonga, <verse eid="JON 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JON 3:2" />“Ughende kune ghumji mkulu ghwa Ninawi, ukawapetele iwanu imbuli yanikulongele.” <verse eid="JON 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JON 3:3" />Apfo Yona kamuhulikitsa Imtwatsa Imulungu kaghenda Ninawi. Ghumji ghwa Ninawi tsa mkulu ng'ani. Imunu kobamighwa yaghende kwa matsuwa madatu mbaka kughumalitsa. <verse eid="JON 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JON 3:4" />Yona tsakanga kwa misi imwe, kuya kengila mna ghumji ghwa Ninawi. Kandusa kuwalongela iwanu, “Ghang'ali matsuwa alubaini ghumji ghwa Ninawi ghutsohinyika.”<verse eid="JON 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JON 3:5" />Iwanu we Ninawi watoghola chayalongile Imulungu kubitila Yona. Apfo walamla waleke ukuja, ne iwanu wose kulawa iwakulu mbaka iwadodo wapfala ghamaghunila kulangusa ka watsileka nzambi tsawo.<verse eid="JON 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JON 3:6" />Imndewa wa Ninawi hayahulike apfo, kenuka mne chighoda chake cha undewa, katsula maghwanda ghake gha undewa, kapfala maghunila na kuya kakala mne lipfu. <verse eid="JON 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JON 3:7" />Tsakawapetela iwanu wa Ninawi imbuli ino, “Aghano malaghitso kulawa kuna nene imndewa ne iwakulu weyangu. Mleke kumleka imunu wala ing'ombe wala imnyama wowose wa kufughighwa yaje. Mleke kuwaleka waje wala ukunwa ichinu chochose. <verse eid="JON 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JON 3:8" />Lekeni iwanu wose ne iwanyama wapfale ghamagunila. Chila imunu yamlombe Imulungu kwa ghumoyo ghwake ghose na yaleke kutenda ghehile ne yaleke ughobo. <verse eid="JON 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JON 3:9" />Songaa Imulungu katsoleka kutenda ghabamile kutenda na kutwonela libatsi, na kuleka kutwonela maya, na ng'atutsokomighwa bae!”<verse eid="JON 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JON 3:10" />Imulungu hayonile pfawatendile, na pfawalekile kutenda ghehile, kaleka chayabamile kutenda, kaleka kuwatowa ka pfayabamile.<verse eid="JON 3:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JON 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JON 4" />
  <para style="s">Ukughudubuka kwa Yona na libatsi lye Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JON 4:1" />Kwa achi ichilawile, Yona ng'adeng'elele bae hata chidogho, apfo tsakaghudubuka ng'ani. <verse eid="JON 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JON 4:2" />Kamlongela Imulungu, “Ghwee Imulungu, imbuli ino si ihila bae yanongile kutsotenda haning'ali mne isi yangu? Apfi pfipfo pfanisumkile kutsumila Tarisisi. Tsanimanya ghweghwe kwa Imulungu yune unoghelo na libatsi, ng'usumkagha bae kona maya, ghweghwe kunogha na kwatayari kughaleka ghamawatso ghako gha kuhigha iwanu. <verse eid="JON 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JON 4:3" />Lelo, ghwee Imtwatsa, undeke nene nife, ng'apfu ning'afa kubita kuwa mghima.”<verse eid="JON 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JON 4:4" />Imtwatsa Imulungu kamwidika, “Apfi kwakona pfinogha ukughudubuka?”<verse eid="JON 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JON 4:5" />Baho Yona kaghenda ubali wa kwalilawila litsua we ghumji. Baho katsenga chibumbulika, kakala hane chimbeho chake, kobeta alole chitsolawila choni mne ghumji ghwa Ninawi. <verse eid="JON 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JON 4:6" />Kuya Imtwatsa Imulungu kahanda ghummeya, nagho ghukula na ghumwing'a Yona chimbeho, chokumhungutsila ukughaya. Yona kaghunoghela ghendo ghummeya aghwo. <verse eid="JON 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JON 4:7" />Lekeni ilupfi yake, hakuchele Imulungu kamlaghitsa imng'onyo aghudafune ghummeya, nagho ghunyala. <verse eid="JON 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JON 4:8" />Litsua halilawile, Imulungu kaghala libeho ililakatsa kulawa kwalilawila litsua, na litsua limlakatsa Yona mwitwi, chidogho yatsilike. Kabama yafe, kalonga, “Pfinogha ning'afile kubita kuwa mghima.”<verse eid="JON 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JON 4:9" />Lekeni Imulungu kamlongela Yona, “Apfi kotenda ghoya kughudubukila ghummeya?” Yona kalonga, “Ona, nighudubuka ng'ani mbaka nobama nife.”<verse eid="JON 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JON 4:10" />Kuya Imulungu kamlongela, “Ghummeya aghu ghukula mna ichilo chimwe, na ghunyala mna chilo chimwe, ghweghwe ng'utendile chinu chochose bae, wala si ghweghwe bae yughutendile ghukule, lekeni koghwonela usungu! <verse eid="JON 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JON 4:11" />Angu lelo ng'apfinoghile bae nene kuwonela libatsi iwanu wengi wa ghumji mkulu ghwa Ninawi. Ghumji ghune iwana iwobita laki imwe na elufu ishilini, yang'awodaha bae kutanga choni chinogha na choni chiha, ghumji ghune iwanyama wengi yang'awodaha kupetighwa?”<verse eid="JON 4:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JON 4" />
</usx>